{"id":"248fe87a7170ad10","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-principal-symbol.md","title":"Principal Symbol","display":"df-principal-symbol — Principal Symbol","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-principal-symbol","aliases":["58-df-principal-symbol"],"display":"df-principal-symbol — Principal Symbol","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-principal-symbol"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-principal-symbol</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-principal-symbol — Principal Symbol"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md\">../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,P,\\Omega,n,m\\in V\">\\(\\sigma,P,\\Omega,n,m\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_j\\coloneqq-i\\partial_{x_j}\">\\(D_j\\coloneqq-i\\partial_{x_j}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76305a7e4d824323\" href=\"?note=76305a7e4d824323\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md\">../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrincipalSymbol}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrincipalSymbol}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}symbol}\\vdash\\mathrm{PrincipalSymbol}_S(\\sigma,P,\\Omega,n,m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(P,\\Omega,n,m)\\land\\exists(a_\\alpha)_{|\\alpha|\\leq m}\\in\\prod_{|\\alpha|\\leq m}C^\\infty(\\Omega)\\;\\left(\\forall u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega)\\;\\left(P(u)=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\leq m}a_\\alpha D^\\alpha u\\right)\\land\\exists\\alpha\\;(|\\alpha|=m\\land a_\\alpha\\neq0)\\land\\sigma:\\Omega\\times\\mathbb R^n\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\forall(x,\\xi)\\in\\Omega\\times\\mathbb R^n\\;\\left(\\sigma(x,\\xi)=\\sum_{|\\alpha|=m}a_\\alpha(x)\\xi^\\alpha\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}symbol}\\vdash\\mathrm{PrincipalSymbol}_S(\\sigma,P,\\Omega,n,m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(P,\\Omega,n,m)\\land\\exists(a_\\alpha)_{|\\alpha|\\leq m}\\in\\prod_{|\\alpha|\\leq m}C^\\infty(\\Omega)\\;\\left(\\forall u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega)\\;\\left(P(u)=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\leq m}a_\\alpha D^\\alpha u\\right)\\land\\exists\\alpha\\;(|\\alpha|=m\\land a_\\alpha\\neq0)\\land\\sigma:\\Omega\\times\\mathbb R^n\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\forall(x,\\xi)\\in\\Omega\\times\\mathbb R^n\\;\\left(\\sigma(x,\\xi)=\\sum_{|\\alpha|=m}a_\\alpha(x)\\xi^\\alpha\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The principal symbol keeps the top-order part; the stated formula uses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_j=-i\\partial_{x_j}\">\\(D_j=-i\\partial_{x_j}\\)</span>, while the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_j=\\partial_{x_j}\">\\(D_j=\\partial_{x_j}\\)</span> convention inserts factors <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i\\xi)^\\alpha\">\\((i\\xi)^\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"76305a7e4d824323","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-differential-operator.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma,P,\\Omega,n,m\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"D_j\\coloneqq-i\\partial_{x_j}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrincipalSymbol}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}symbol}\\vdash\\mathrm{PrincipalSymbol}_S(\\sigma,P,\\Omega,n,m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DiffOp}_S(P,\\Omega,n,m)\\land\\exists(a_\\alpha)_{|\\alpha|\\leq m}\\in\\prod_{|\\alpha|\\leq m}C^\\infty(\\Omega)\\;\\left(\\forall u\\in C^\\infty(\\Omega)\\;\\left(P(u)=\\sum_{|\\alpha|\\leq m}a_\\alpha D^\\alpha u\\right)\\land\\exists\\alpha\\;(|\\alpha|=m\\land a_\\alpha\\neq0)\\land\\sigma:\\Omega\\times\\mathbb R^n\\to\\mathbb C\\land\\forall(x,\\xi)\\in\\Omega\\times\\mathbb R^n\\;\\left(\\sigma(x,\\xi)=\\sum_{|\\alpha|=m}a_\\alpha(x)\\xi^\\alpha\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"D_j=-i\\partial_{x_j}","display":false},{"tex":"D_j=\\partial_{x_j}","display":false},{"tex":"(i\\xi)^\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":1258,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d5fef79e71e464f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-990","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-principal-symbol.md|58-df-principal-symbol]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["76305a7e4d824323"]}